      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783066235588,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O(1)  - Constant time complx\nO(n)  - Linear \nO(log n) - Lograthimic\nO(n^2) - Quadratic\n\n\n- Worst case asume kore cholte hobe ,then n er sathe compare kore O(.....) te ans hobe\n- Lowe power wala neglet hoye jabe , only max power wala n thakbe\n- Constant bad chole jabe \n- Array jodi define er time ei or size diye dey like a[20] , it means constant time O(1) ,\n- For loop , check how many times the code actually run  .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "O(1)  - Constant time complx\nO(n)  - Linear \nO(log n) - Lograthimic\nO(n^2) - Quadratic\n\n\n- Worst case asume kore cholte hobe ,then n er sathe compare kore O(.....) te ans hobe\n- Lowe power wala neglet hoye jabe , only max power wala n thakbe\n- Constant bad chole jabe \n- Array jodi define er time ei or size diye dey like a[20] , it means constant time O(1) ,\n- For loop , check how many times the code actually run  .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
